{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root validation found a current signing documentation drift cluster. The public sign help still calls the operation HMAC signing. README.md, docs/manifest-signing.md, docs/event-schema.md, docs/reuse-surface.md, docs/repo-snapshot-gates.md, docs/plan-review-gate.md, docs/llm-framework.md, and docs/sample-ticket-log.jsonl also describe HMAC operation certificates as current. The sign result schema and current implementation state that sign_manifest emits asymmetric sshsig operation certificates. Legacy HMAC utilities remain only for compatibility or non-operation-certificate consumers. This correction requires one coordinated source and generated-help sweep rather than isolated wording changes. No project files changed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787288139277314001,"uuid":"8db973fa-e559-416b-94c4-6246e288a4b8"}